WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,920
Does it matter who taught you?

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:02,960
Didn't you always say

3
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:03,920
No lighter for me

4
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,160
Can you only eat raw food?

5
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,120
From tomorrow onwards, save this sentence

6
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,440
Keep the lighter for yourself

7
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:10,560
Don't take it out and spin it eight times in one night

8
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,640
Common sense is good

9
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,800
You might as well try it out yourself

10
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:20,540
It has nothing to do with you. Where are you going?

11
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,020
I have to ask you to go to the toilet

12
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,260
Can't see you tonight?

13
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,620
None of your business

14
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,340
How about we go together tomorrow?

15
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,340
who is with you
